This package repackages the official MAFFT 7.505 Windows x64 binary
distribution. It does not compile MAFFT or run any upstream Makefile in CYAN.

The payload archive contains `mafft.bat` and the native `usr/lib/mafft`
executables exactly as shipped by the MAFFT project. The runtime archive
contains a curated subset of the MSYS2 environment from the same official
bundle: bash and the utilities the MAFFT launcher actually invokes. The
upstream source for MAFFT core is available at the upstream URL; the bundled
runtime components keep their upstream licenses, listed in
`LICENSE-MSYS2.txt`.
